        <mxCell id="bGAilfCWtUQ7A0YQxOPz-30" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontSize=14;align=left;spacingLeft=14;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;BASELINE CONTRACT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• Main stream luôn chạy đủ 24 ViT blocks.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• N_patch không đổi trong 24 ViT blocks.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• DeepStack lấy feature cố định sau block 6, 12 và 18.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• Không có token pruning hay lựa chọn token động trước merger.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• Các merger 2×2 cố định làm giảm:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; Npatch → Nvisual = Npatch / 4.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• Main output và ba DeepStack outputs đều có shape:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; [Nvisual, 2048].&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="231" width="490" x="1090" y="1380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bGAilfCWtUQ7A0YQxOPz-31" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontSize=13;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b&gt;Tra embedding cho toàn bộ token&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;- Input: input_ids [B, N_total]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;- Thực hiện:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&#09;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); white-space: normal;&quot;&gt;+ Dùng token ID để tra bảng embedding đã học&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&#09;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); white-space: normal;&quot;&gt;+ Mỗi ID đổi thành vector 2048 chiều&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#09;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;+ Áp dụng cho mọi vị trí: text, special token, &amp;lt;image_pad&amp;gt; và padding (nếu có)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;- Output:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&#09;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); white-space: normal;&quot;&gt;+ inputs_embeds [B, N_total, 2048]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;(đây là chuỗi embedding trước khi thay vector ảnh)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="181" width="492" x="3908.0" y="780" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
