          <mxGeometry height="145" width="850" x="400" y="2044" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bGAilfCWtUQ7A0YQxOPz-70" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b&gt;DeepStack merger difference&lt;/b&gt;&#10;The three DeepStack branches group the same 2×2 patches first, then apply LayerNorm over the grouped 4096-D representation before the same 4096→4096→2048 MLP. Each branch therefore emits [Nvisual,2048]." vertex="1">
