        <mxCell id="bGAilfCWtUQ7A0YQxOPz-94" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6B7280;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=14;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b&gt;Token definitions used in experiments&lt;/b&gt;&#10;• Npatch: unmerged ViT patch tokens.&#10;• Nvisual: tokens after the built-in 2×2 merger; this is the baseline visual-token count.&#10;• Ntext_and_special: all non-image-placeholder text/control positions.&#10;• Ntotal: decoder prefill length and recorded input_tokens.&#10;• retained_visual_ratio = Nvisual_after_experimental_pruning / Nvisual_baseline." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="210" width="1420" x="400" y="2589" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bGAilfCWtUQ7A0YQxOPz-95" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=14;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b&gt;DeepStack shape contract&lt;/b&gt;&#10;Three fixed feature tensors, each [Nvisual,2048], are injected after language layers 0, 1, and 2 only at image_mask positions. They reuse intermediate visual features but neither create new token positions nor reduce the sequence length." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="210" width="1420" x="1860" y="2589" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bGAilfCWtUQ7A0YQxOPz-96" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=14;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b&gt;Full-token baseline contract&lt;/b&gt;&#10;No learned, random, attention-based, question-aware, or adaptive token pruning is applied. The only token-count reduction is Qwen3-VL's built-in deterministic 2×2 PatchMerger. Future methods must compare against this exact path and model revision." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="210" width="1420" x="3320" y="2589" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bGAilfCWtUQ7A0YQxOPz-97" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6B7280;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=14;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b&gt;Required comparison axes&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;font color=&quot;#067647&quot;&gt;Quality:&lt;/font&gt; GQA accuracy • MMBench accuracy • MME accuracy, Accuracy+, total score.&#10;&lt;font color=&quot;#2855D9&quot;&gt;Efficiency:&lt;/font&gt; retained visual-token ratio • latency • throughput • peak VRAM • FLOPs/compute proxy.&#10;&lt;font color=&quot;#9C2C77&quot;&gt;Controls:&lt;/font&gt; full-token • random-K • uniform-K • question-aware fixed-K." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="210" width="1440" x="4780" y="2589" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
