        <mxCell id="dsf-legend" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:20px'&gt;INTERVENTION MAP — các điểm có thể giảm visual token&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;P0&lt;/b&gt; Processor / resize (max_pixels): giảm cả ViT + LLM. &lt;i&gt;Chỉ dùng làm baseline đối chứng (resolution-matched), không phải phương pháp.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;P1&lt;/b&gt; Bên trong ViT (merge/drop giữa các block): giảm cả ViT. &lt;i&gt;Mở rộng sau, chưa thuộc DSFold v1.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;P2&lt;/b&gt; Sau PatchMerger, trước fusion — &lt;b&gt;DSFold đặt ở đây&lt;/b&gt;: chọn K token, gộp (fold) phần bị bỏ vào DeepStack, giữ toạ độ M-RoPE gốc. Giảm toàn bộ LLM prefill + KV cache.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;P3&lt;/b&gt; Bên trong LLM sau layer k≥3 (kiểu FastV): &lt;i&gt;baseline so sánh&lt;/i&gt;; k≥3 thì không đụng tới DeepStack.&lt;br&gt;Lưu ý: với 2B, ViT ≈ 46% compute của mỗi visual token → P2/P3 không giảm thời gian ViT." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=18;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#B20000;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#000000;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="360" y="250" width="3400" height="260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dsf-section" value="2½. PP3 = DSFold (set D-1.0) + SCORE HEAD HỌC ĐƯỢC (P2)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF5F5;strokeColor=#B20000;strokeWidth=4;dashed=1;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#B20000;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2790" y="709" width="1060" height="951" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dsf-badge-p2" value="P2" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#B20000;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3775" y="721" width="56" height="56" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dsf-in-ds" value="&lt;b&gt;IN: DeepStack features f₁, f₂, f₃&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;3 × [N_visual, 2048] (từ ViT block 6/12/18)&lt;br&gt;→ dùng để &lt;b&gt;chấm điểm&lt;/b&gt; và để &lt;b&gt;fold&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#000000;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2820" y="780" width="490" height="105" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dsf-in-q" value="&lt;b&gt;IN: Question token embeddings&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;q = embed(input_ids của câu hỏi) [N_q, 2048]&lt;br&gt;(lấy từ bảng embedding, chưa chạy LLM)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#000000;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3330" y="780" width="490" height="105" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dsf-in-main" value="&lt;b&gt;IN: Main visual embeddings&lt;/b&gt; v [N_visual, 2048]&lt;br&gt;+ toạ độ lưới gốc (t, h, w) của từng token" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#000000;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2820" y="900" width="490" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dsf-budget" value="&lt;b&gt;Budget&lt;/b&gt; (7 mức cố định)&lt;br&gt;K = clip(⌈r · N_visual⌉, 1, N)&lt;br&gt;r ∈ {1/18, 1/9, 2/9, 1/3, 1/2, 3/4, 1} = L1…L7" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#000000;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3330" y="900" width="490" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dsf-score" value="&lt;b&gt;S1 (PP3 THAY THẾ). Điểm chất lượng từng token = SCORE HEAD 3a&lt;/b&gt; — chi tiết ở panel E&lt;br&gt;• PP1 gốc: q_i = exp(α·z_rel + β·z_ms) (α=1, β=0.5) — chỉ còn làm &lt;i&gt;đặc trưng đầu vào&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;• PP3: s_i = MLP([u_i ; x_q ; P_v(v_i) ⊙ x_q]),  &lt;b&gt;q̂_i = softplus(s_i) + 10⁻³&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Huấn luyện offline bằng nhãn saliency gradient×input (panel F); ≈0.78 M tham số, +≈4 ms/mẫu" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#6A1B9A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;fontColor=#000000;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;verticalAlign=top;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2820" y="1010" width="1000" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dsf-select" value="&lt;b&gt;S2. Select&lt;/b&gt; — greedy MAP-DPP (giữ nguyên PP1)&lt;br&gt;L = diag(q̂) · cos(v,v) · diag(q̂) → I_keep (K), I_drop&lt;br&gt;(N &amp;gt; 4096: weighted max–min)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#000000;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2820" y="1180" width="490" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dsf-assign" value="&lt;b&gt;S3. Assign&lt;/b&gt; (giữ nguyên PP1)&lt;br&gt;a(d) = argmax_k cos(v_d, v_k) − λ·dist_grid(d,k), λ=0.5" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#000000;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3330" y="1180" width="490" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dsf-fold" value="&lt;b&gt;S4. Fold DeepStack&lt;/b&gt; (giữ nguyên PP1)&lt;br&gt;f′ₗ[k] = norm-match(fₗ[k] + γ · Σ_{a(d)=k} softmax(cos(v_d,v_k)/τ) · fₗ[d]),  γ=0.5, τ=0.1, l = 1..3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#000000;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2820" y="1310" width="1000" height="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dsf-out-main" value="&lt;b&gt;OUT: v[I_keep]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;[K, 2048]&lt;br&gt;→ thay cho Main visual embeddings khi masked_scatter" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#000000;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2820" y="1455" width="320" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dsf-out-ds" value="&lt;b&gt;OUT: DeepStack′ ×3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;3 × [K, 2048] (đã fold)&lt;br&gt;→ cộng ở decoder layer 0 / 1 / 2" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#000000;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3160" y="1455" width="320" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dsf-out-pos" value="&lt;b&gt;OUT: I_keep + toạ độ gốc&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• input_ids: N_visual → K &amp;lt;|image_pad|&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;• position_ids: &lt;b&gt;gather&lt;/b&gt; cột giữ lại từ M-RoPE đầy đủ&lt;br&gt;• rope_deltas tính lại cho decode" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#000000;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3500" y="1455" width="320" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
