        <mxCell id="pp3-f-pp3-f-val-pp3-f-ckpt" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#6A1B9A;strokeWidth=3;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="pp3-f-val" target="pp3-f-ckpt">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pp3-f-metric" value="&lt;b&gt;Chất lượng nhãn &amp;amp; ranking&lt;/b&gt; (tập ảnh giữ lại, mức L3 = 22%)&lt;br&gt;• top-22% token theo saliency chứa 69% tổng saliency → nhãn đủ 'nhọn' để học&lt;br&gt;• Recall@K (trùng top-K saliency): &lt;b&gt;score head 3a 0.536&lt;/b&gt; vs công thức PP1 0.348 vs ngẫu nhiên ≈ 0.22&lt;br&gt;• Train loss tiếp tục giảm (3.00) còn held-out tăng sau epoch 6 → overfit nhẹ, đã chặn bằng best checkpoint" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=18;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6A1B9A;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;fontColor=#000000;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="400" y="4200" width="3400" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pp3-f-cmds" value="&lt;b&gt;Lệnh&lt;/b&gt; (scripts/pp3/)&lt;br&gt;fit_compressor.py → make_saliency_labels.py → train_score_head.py --arch 3a --seed 0&lt;br&gt;→ plot_training.py  (log: outputs/pp3_scorer/training/history_3a_seed0.{json,png})" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=18;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6A1B9A;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;fontColor=#000000;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3900" y="4200" width="3440" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pp3-panel-g" value="G. KẾT QUẢ GQA DEV (1 020 mẫu, cùng id với baseline full-token = 0.615)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F0FA;strokeColor=#6A1B9A;strokeWidth=4;dashed=1;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#6A1B9A;arcSize=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="360" y="4500" width="7020" height="470" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pp3-g-table" value="&lt;table border='1' cellpadding='6' width='100%' style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:20px'&gt;&lt;tr style='background:#EEE'&gt;&lt;th&gt;Mức&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Token ảnh giữ (K / N≈265)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Input LLM&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;PP3 3a&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Δ vs baseline (p McNemar)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;PP1 bộ D&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Δ vs baseline (p)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;L3 (22%)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;59&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;85&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;0.606&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;−0.9 (0.34)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;0.573&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;−4.2 (&amp;lt;0.001)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;L4 (33%)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;88&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;114&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;0.606&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;−0.9 (0.25)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;0.585&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;−2.9 (0.001)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;L5 (50%)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;132&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;158&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;0.605&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;−1.0 (0.14)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;0.604&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;−1.1 (0.20)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;L6 (75%)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;198&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;224&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;0.614&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;−0.1 (1.0)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;0.615&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;0.0 (0.86)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=15;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="400" y="4570" width="3900" height="260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pp3-g-read" value="&lt;b&gt;Đọc kết quả&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 3a giữ ≈ 0.606 phẳng từ L3 → L5; PP1-D tụt nhanh khi giảm token.&lt;br&gt;• Ở L3: 3a thắng PP1-D +3.3 điểm (p ≈ 0.002), chỉ 3c −1.2 điểm so với 3a.&lt;br&gt;• So với baseline: chưa vượt; mọi mức chênh không có ý nghĩa thống kê (SE ≈ ±0.7 điểm).&lt;br&gt;• Chưa có: L1/L2, MMBench, MME, seed 1–2." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=18;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6A1B9A;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;fontColor=#000000;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="4400" y="4570" width="2940" height="260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
